    "\n",
    "## Objective\n",
    "Validate that each Vehicle Identification Number (VIN) contains exactly 17 characters. Create a masked version of the VIN to protect sensitive information during data export.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Expected Outcome\n",
    "- VINs are validated.\n",
    "- Invalid VINs are identified.\n",
